@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Search and filter the directory
actor "Authorized user" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "LeadDirectoryPage / LeadDirectoryView" as page
  participant "ILeadService / LeadService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "LeadsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "ListLeadsQueryHandler" as handler
  participant "LeadContact" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Type search text, or choose a category or page
page -> page : View emits filtersChanged; the page writes search, category, and page to the route query (a search or category change resets page 1); filters return as the view's input
alt Typed search text
  page -> page : The view's query signal takes the search once it has been stable for about 250 ms
else Category, page, or Clear filter
  page -> page : The query signal changes at once (no debounce)
end
page -> page : Show loading skeleton while the resource status is loading
page -> client : leadsResource (created once in LeadDirectoryView's injection context) reads the new ListLeadsQuery
opt This view's previous directory read is still in flight
  client -> client : Unsubscribe the superseded request; HttpClient cancels it; it updates no state
end
client -> access : GET /api/leads?search&category&page&pageSize
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry
access -> db : Read current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid, or expired JWT; inactive account
  access --> client : 401; audit denial without payloads
  client -> client : sessionInterceptor: a 401 for the current session generation calls SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once
  client --> page : Navigation to sign-in destroys the view, which cancels its read; the directory route is restored after sign-in
else Authenticated (every role reads contacts in profile P)
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
ctrl -> validation : Send ListLeadsQuery through MediatR 12.5.0
validation -> validation : L2-045 page >= 1; page size 1-100; known category
alt Unknown category, page below 1, or page size outside 1-100 (an outdated or edited link)
  validation --> ctrl : 400 field message for category, page, or pageSize; nothing read
  ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
  client --> page : Resource status error (400); filter-invalid state: the field message and Clear filter, which writes the full directory at page 1 to the route query; no rows, paging, or chip counts; no Try again or reference ID; announce the message
else Valid request
  validation -> handler : Handle ListLeadsQuery
  handler -> db : One snapshot read transaction: L2-010 / L2-037.1 escaped substring search AND category, ordered last name, first name, ID; one page
  db --> handler : Page rows, total matching count, five category totals from the same snapshot
  handler -> entity : Project safe contact rows; isCityLead from category and designated email
  entity --> handler : LeadDirectoryResult
  handler --> ctrl : Typed result
  ctrl --> client : 200 items, totalCount, categoryTotals
  client --> page : Resource status resolved; value holds the LeadDirectoryResult for the current query
  alt Zero matches
    page -> page : Show zero-result message with Clear filter; announce "No <category> leads found"
  else Matches
    page -> page : Render rows, pagination, and chip counts; announce "N leads found"
  end
  page --> actor : Results, counts, and controls stay reachable at every width; Add lead, Edit, and Delete only when canManageLeads, else the read-only notice
end
end
note over ctrl, db
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043);
the view shows its load-error state with the reference ID; Try again calls reload().
With no response there is no reference ID, and the shell's offline banner appears.
Diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads.
end note
@enduml
